1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,339
In this chapter, we will learn the basic production process of CLO core tools and clothing.

2
00:00:07,339 --> 00:00:11,560
First is the arrangement of core tools.

3
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:17,359
Open the library.

4
00:00:17,359 --> 00:00:20,199
Select Connect.

5
00:00:20,199 --> 00:00:26,400
Select CLO Training here in the Connect official account.

6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:35,300
Then enter the core tool to search.

7
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:39,200
Press Return.

8
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:43,000
Select Core Tools Automatic Arrangement.

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Double-click to open.

10
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,800
Then close the library.

11
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,300
The current version is already in 2D.

12
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:59,400
The window is arranged.

13
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:03,700
Now we need to arrange this T-shirt version to the model.

14
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:11,240
Here we can use the Automatic 3D Arrangement tool.

15
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:13,640
Click Run.

16
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:18,800
The Automatic Arrangement tool will automatically arrange its position based on the form of the version.

17
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:22,659
Select Confirm.

18
00:01:22,659 --> 00:01:25,600
You can see that the current version is automatically arranged in the model.

19
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:26,100
select Confirm. You can see that the current version is automatically arranged in the model.

20
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:31,100
This is the automatic arrangement.

21
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:39,100
Of course, in addition to this, we can also use the manual arrangement panel to adjust the corresponding position on the model.

22
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:43,100
Open the library.

23
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:46,100
Select the core tool, Arrangements.

24
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:52,100
Double-click to open.

25
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:55,100
Select Confirm.

26
00:01:56,100 --> 00:02:01,100
We open a new project file.

27
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:05,100
Close the library.

28
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:14,100
We can use the virtual model information display to display the arrangement points to open the arrangement points on the model.

29
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:21,100
At this time, you can see that there are many blue points around the model.

30
00:02:21,100 --> 00:02:25,100
There are two arrangement points here.

31
00:02:26,099 --> 00:02:31,099
The center axis is a pure blue point.

32
00:02:31,099 --> 00:02:33,099
It is an asymmetric arrangement point.

33
00:02:33,099 --> 00:02:37,099
There is a white circle outside the point on both sides.

34
00:02:37,099 --> 00:02:42,099
It means that it is an symmetrical arrangement point.

35
00:02:42,099 --> 00:02:45,099
Next, we arrange the panels.

36
00:02:45,099 --> 00:02:51,099
Left-click to select the panel.

37
00:02:51,099 --> 00:02:55,099
Then put the mouse on the model's arrangement point.

38
00:02:56,099 --> 00:03:00,099
You can see that there is a gray preview at this time.

39
00:03:00,099 --> 00:03:03,099
We can put it on different points.

40
00:03:03,099 --> 00:03:10,099
Preview the arrangement position of the current panel.

41
00:03:10,099 --> 00:03:14,099
We choose the arrangement point on the center axis.

42
00:03:14,099 --> 00:03:20,099
Then left-click to set the arrangement point.

43
00:03:20,099 --> 00:03:24,099
The panel is arranged in the corresponding position on the model.

44
00:03:24,099 --> 00:03:30,099
Next, arrange the back of the model's clothing.

45
00:03:30,099 --> 00:03:35,099
We can press the arrow on the keyboard to switch to the back view.

46
00:03:35,099 --> 00:03:37,099
Select the back of the clothing.

47
00:03:37,099 --> 00:03:39,099
Arrange its position.

48
00:03:39,099 --> 00:03:42,099
Since the back of the clothing is symmetrical,

49
00:03:42,099 --> 00:03:45,099
One side is arranged,

50
00:03:45,099 --> 00:03:48,099
The other side is also arranged.

51
00:03:48,099 --> 00:03:52,099
And the panel is facing the front and facing the back.

52
00:03:54,099 --> 00:03:57,099
Back to the front view.

53
00:03:57,099 --> 00:04:03,099
Arrange the belt panels.

54
00:04:03,099 --> 00:04:06,099
And the eight on the keyboard in the reverse view.

55
00:04:06,099 --> 00:04:13,099
Arrange the belt panels on the back.

56
00:04:13,099 --> 00:04:14,099
After arranging,

57
00:04:14,099 --> 00:04:18,100
See the attribute editor on the right side.

58
00:04:18,100 --> 00:04:23,100
Slide the wheel to the bottom to see the arrangement.

59
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:26,100
We can adjust the arrangement of the parameters here.

60
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:32,100
To adjust the position of the belt panels on the back.

61
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:34,100
First of all, you can see.

62
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:38,100
When adjusting the position of the X-axis parameters.

63
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:47,100
The panel is rotating around the model's body level.

64
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:51,100
When we adjust the position of the Y-axis parameters.

65
00:04:51,100 --> 00:05:00,100
The panel is moving vertically on the model's body.

66
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:03,100
Entering the value can also adjust the position of the panel.

67
00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:07,100
The Y-axis refers to the distance between the panel and the model's body.

68
00:05:07,100 --> 00:05:11,100
Adjusting parameters can see the changes in the arrangement of the panel position.

69
00:05:11,100 --> 00:05:20,100
Switch to the view to check.

70
00:05:20,100 --> 00:05:23,100
The direction can change the direction of the panel.

71
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:25,100
When adjusting the direction of the parameters.

72
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:33,100
The direction of the entire panel is also changing.

73
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:36,100
We can adjust these parameters.

74
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:38,100
To adjust through the arrangement point.

75
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:43,100
Arrange the position of the panel on the model.

76
00:05:43,100 --> 00:05:46,100
Then press the 2 on the keyboard.

77
00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:48,100
Back to the front view.

78
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:53,100
Next, arrange the panel of the skirt.

79
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:54,100
Here.

80
00:05:54,100 --> 00:05:56,100
We can arrange the skirt in the model.

81
00:05:56,100 --> 00:05:59,100
The position of the front, middle and bottom.

82
