88
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:19,100
Press 8 to the rear view.

89
00:06:19,100 --> 00:06:21,100
Arrange the skirt at the back.

90
00:06:21,100 --> 00:06:23,100
At the same time, you can use the positioning ball.

91
